# Sprinklr email attachments (RE)

**Chat scope:** Email processing agent (`EMAIL-PROCESSING-AGENT.md`).

**Purpose (only this):** Open or download attachments so the agent can **read what the customer sent** and have a **complete understanding of the case** before drafting the 7-step RE. Not a separate workflow, not Case Tracker logging, not an arm trigger.

When an EMAIL case shows **Anhang** / **Anhänge**, review those files as part of RE analysis (IDs on scans, screenshots, forms, PDFs, etc.). Do not ignore visible attachments that change what the customer is asking or proving.

## Detection

| Signal | Meaning |
|--------|---------|
| Text **1 Anhang** / **N Anhänge** | Attachment block present |
| `section[data-tracker-event-id="@conversation/chatItemsList/mediaPreviewCard"]` | One attachment card (`data-index` 0, 1, …) |
| Filename under card (e.g. `28422.jpg`, `*.pdf`) | Use in RE notes |

## Actions (hover toolbar)

Hover the media preview card so `div[data-testid="BLOCK_ITEM_ACTIONS"]` appears (top-right of card).

| Goal | Button | Selectors |
|------|--------|-----------|
| **Open / preview** (preferred for PDFs; also images) | **View Detail** | `button[data-testid="VIEW_DETAIL-iconBtn-with-tooltip"]` or `button[data-entityid="VIEW_DETAIL"]` |
| **Download** | **Download** | `button[data-testid="DOWNLOAD-iconBtn-with-tooltip"]` or `button[data-entityid="DOWNLOAD"]` |

**PDFs / some files:** A plain click on the card thumbnail often does **not** open the file. Always use **View Detail** after hover.

**Images (jpg/png/…):** Prefer **View Detail** so the agent can read/OCR the content; or download then read from disk.

## Download folder (mandatory)

All attachment downloads go **only** here:

`C:\Users\PC ENTER\Downloads\yoummday temporaries`

Create the folder if missing. Do not leave downloads in the default Downloads root.

## Helper script (preferred)

```powershell
# List + open View Detail for every card on the visible case
uv run python .cursor/skills/sprinklr-read-answer-email/open_case_attachments.py --view

# Download all to yoummday temporaries
uv run python .cursor/skills/sprinklr-read-answer-email/open_case_attachments.py --download
```

Expect `ATTACHMENTS_FOUND N=…` / `ATTACHMENT_VIEWED` / `ATTACHMENT_DOWNLOADED` / `ATTACHMENTS_NONE`.

## When to run (EMAIL RE)

1. After extract / CUSTOMER EMAIL (typed **RE** or `--await-arm`)  
2. **Before** finishing the 7-step draft if attachments exist — so section 1 / verification / handling reflect the full case (body + attachments)  
3. Briefly note what the attachment shows if it matters; no need for a separate “attachment report” section  

## Hard bans

- Do **not** skip visible Anhänge when they matter for understanding the case  
- Do **not** download to any path other than **yoummday temporaries**  
- Do **not** treat View Detail / Download as arm triggers (not Anwenden / Next / Weiter)  
- Do **not** put attachment filenames or counts in Case Tracker **Notiz** (Notiz stays empty)
